OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry through the evening and overnight.
OL,7,FVariable cloud with clear spells,
OL,8,Fespecially in the east, leading to a
OL,9,Fchillier night than of late.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,12,Fthe day and staying mostly dry in the
OL,13,Fmorning, though a few showers are
OL,14,Fpossible during late afternoon into
OL,15,Fthe evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
